# Proxmox LXC-only container runtime; the Docker flow never uses it.
#
# The one LXC-side helper the Docker flow does use, the guest's own address over
# the ttyS1 control channel, deliberately does NOT live here:
# scripts/container/zd1200-guest-address is at the top level, the path the
# entrypoint computes ("$work_dir/zd1200-guest-address"), so COPY of
# scripts/container/ carries it (docker/Dockerfile).  Moving it back under this
# directory would exclude it from the image and the entrypoint would silently
# print the static GUEST_IP again, which is the defect this note prevents.
scripts/container/proxmox/
